{
  "abstract": "Closed untyped de Bruijn lambda terms under full beta reachability of Church numerals compute exactly the unary partial numerical functions computed by finite three-symbol unary Turing machines. The package defines translations in both directions and proves pointwise numerical-result and no-result equivalences.",
